Anya P: Quick heads-up 1: PR #4402 touches code samples for streaming + pagination across py/ts/go. We changed the stream iterator and pagination token naming. Can we update snippets and a short migration blurb?
Sam W: I'll update Go examples. Will swap Chunks() loop to StreamIter pattern.
Mike L: I'll handle Python streaming + a tiny retry example (exponential backoff, small cap). Will keep it snippet-sized.
Nina K: Doing TS samples and imports. Also will scan for broken links/anchors.
Jules R (docs-bot): CI: docs-build linkcheck flagged /docs/streams-legacy.md -> 404.
Anya P: Fix link to /docs/streams.md and note that pagination uses next_page_token now. Add one short mapping: page -> page_token, per_page -> page_size.
Sam W: Go snippet diff: ```go
// old
resp, _ := client.Stream(ctx, req)
for c := range resp.Chunks() { fmt.Println(c.Text) }

// new
it := client.StreamIter(ctx, req)
for it.Next() { fmt.Println(it.Value().Text) }
```
Mike L: Py snippet: ```py
# new iterator + tiny retry
from time import sleep

def retry(fn, tries=3):
  for i in range(tries):
    try: return fn()
    except TransientError:
      sleep(min(2**i, 5))
  raise

with client.stream_iter(prompt) as it:
  for chunk in it:
    print(chunk.text)
```
Nina K: TS snippet: ```ts
// old
const s = client.stream(req)
s.on('data', c => console.log(c.text))

// new
for await (const chunk of client.streamIter(req)) {
  console.log(chunk.text)
}
```
Anya P: Nice. Small docs note: explicitly say "don't retry on 4xx" next to retry snippet. Also add the one-liner migration paragraph and fix the broken link.
Jules R (docs-bot): Deploy preview for PR #4402: https://deploy-preview-4402--docs.redwood.ai (linkcheck fixed).
Anya P: Thanks everyone; merging in ~1h if CI stays green.
